<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document>
<name>Chumphon sidewalk route G8 (10-group plan)</name>
<Style id="g8film"><LineStyle><color>ff1a89a4</color><width>5</width></LineStyle></Style>
<Style id="g8opt"><LineStyle><color>991a89a4</color><width>4</width></LineStyle></Style>
<Style id="g8con"><LineStyle><color>ff8a8a8a</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style>
<Folder><name>Group 8</name>
<Placemark><name>G8 START</name><description>Junction of Soi Pisist Payabal 3 &amp; Krommaluang Chumphon Rd (ถ.กรมหลวงชุมพร)</description><Point><coordinates>99.18329,10.50027,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G8 step 1: Krommaluang Chumphon Rd</name><description>Start here. Head east along Krommaluang Chumphon Rd (ถ.กรมหลวงชุมพร) for about 310 m, passing Soi Krumluang Chumphon Soi 3, Soi Krumluang Chumphon 3/1, to the junction with Soi Krumluang Chumphon 5.</description><styleUrl>#g8film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18329,10.50027,0 99.18375,10.50018,0 99.18382,10.50016,0 99.18528,10.49986,0 99.18552,10.49981,0 99.18606,10.4997,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G8 step 2: Phisit Phayaban Rd</name><description>Turn right onto Phisit Phayaban Rd (ถ.พิศิษฐ์พยาบาล), heading south for about 360 m to the junction with Prachauthid Rd (ถ.ประชาอุทิศ) / Saha Korn Rd (ถ.สหกรณ์).</description><styleUrl>#g8film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18606,10.4997,0 99.18591,10.49913,0 99.18583,10.49882,0 99.18572,10.49839,0 99.18559,10.49792,0 99.18558,10.49785,0 99.1855,10.49757,0 99.18548,10.4975,0 99.18536,10.49704,0 99.18524,10.49657,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G8 step 3: Sanam Kila Rd</name><description>Turn left onto Sanam Kila Rd (ถ.สนามกีฬา), heading east for about 260 m to where it meets Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6.</description><styleUrl>#g8film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18524,10.49657,0 99.18605,10.49639,0 99.18618,10.49636,0 99.18757,10.49604,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G8 step 4: Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6</name><description>Turn left onto Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6, heading north for about 80 m to where it meets Lane inside the sports ground (ถนนภายในสนามกีฬา).</description><styleUrl>#g8film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18757,10.49604,0 99.18759,10.49613,0 99.18774,10.4967,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G8 step 5: Lane inside the sports ground</name><description>Turn right onto Lane inside the sports ground (ถนนภายในสนามกีฬา), heading east for about 30 m to the next junction.</description><styleUrl>#g8film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18774,10.4967,0 99.1879,10.49666,0 99.18803,10.49662,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G8 step 6: Lane inside the sports ground</name><description>Turn right to stay on Lane inside the sports ground (ถนนภายในสนามกีฬา), heading south for about 130 m to the next junction.</description><styleUrl>#g8film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18803,10.49662,0 99.18774,10.49544,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G8 step 7: Lane inside the sports ground (connect only)</name><description>Turn right and walk along Lane inside the sports ground (ถนนภายในสนามกีฬา), heading west for about 30 m to where it meets Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6. [Connecting walk - no filming needed]</description><styleUrl>#g8con</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18774,10.49544,0 99.1876,10.49547,0 99.18744,10.49551,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G8 step 8: Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6</name><description>Turn right onto Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6, heading north for about 60 m to the finish point.</description><styleUrl>#g8film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18744,10.49551,0 99.18755,10.49597,0 99.18757,10.49604,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G8 FINISH</name><description>Junction of Sanam Kila Rd (ถ.สนามกีฬา) &amp; Soi Krumluang Chumphon 6</description><Point><coordinates>99.18757,10.49604,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder>
</Document></kml>